sequenceDiagram
    actor R as Reader
    participant K as Reader App
    participant A as LiBot API
    participant S as Facility Guidance Service
    participant D as Repositories
    participant DB as SQL Server
    participant B as Robot Runtime

    R->>K: 1. Find and select an area
    K->>A: 2. Search area
    A->>S: 3. Find area
    S->>D: 4. Load area details
    D->>DB: 5. Read area data
    DB-->>D: 6. Area data
    D-->>S: 7. Area details
    S-->>A: 8. Area details
    A-->>K: 9. Return area
    K-->>R: 10. Show area

    R->>K: 11. Confirm guidance
    K->>A: 12. Request guidance
    A->>A: 13. Validate request
    A->>S: 14. Start guidance
    S->>D: 15. Create job
    D->>DB: 16. Save job data
    DB-->>D: 17. Job saved
    D-->>S: 18. Job details
    S->>B: 19. Start robot task
    B-->>S: 20. Accept task
    S-->>A: 21. Execution details
    A-->>K: 22. Guidance started

    B->>B: 23. Navigate to area
    loop Each workflow step
        B->>A: Report step result
        A->>D: Save step result
        D->>DB: Save result
        D-->>A: Result saved
    end

    K->>A: 24. Check progress
    A->>S: 25. Get progress
    S->>B: 26. Check robot progress
    B-->>S: 27. Current progress
    S-->>A: 28. Progress details
    A-->>K: 29. Show progress
    K->>A: 30. Submit final result
    A->>D: 31. Update job status
    D->>DB: 32. Save job status
    K-->>R: 33. Show result
    R->>K: 34. Submit rating
    K->>A: 35. Save rating
    A->>D: 36. Record rating
    D->>DB: 37. Save rating
    DB-->>D: Rating saved
